WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-So, I wanna ask you

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
about this --
In the wake

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.572 align:start size:94% position:6%
of Tara Reade's allegation
against Joe Biden,

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:09.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
you wrote a really beautifully
written post on Medium,

00:00:09.242 --> 00:00:10.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I recommend
everybody check out.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:16.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
You talked about being a sexua
assault survivor, yourself

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.684 line:92%
and how survivors' justice

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:20.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
is a really hard thing
to achieve.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
How do you think moments
like this need to be addressed

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:24.391 line:92%
regardless of political party?

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:26.459 size:84% position:42%
-Well, they have to be
addressed in good faith

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:29.062 size:88% position:44%
and I have to, you know,
just point out the fact

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:33.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I think many
who are offering commentar

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.101
in the discourse are not
doing that in good faith.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:38.138
They don't care about survivors'
healing and justice.

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:40.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
They don't care
about due process.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.908 size:84% position:42%
You know, they're doing
what people have done

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:44.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
for far too long,
and that is to take this issue

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:46.146 line:92%
to take my survivor community,

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:48.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
and use people as politica
fodder and footballs.

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:51.117
These are the same people
that vote consistently

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:54.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
against the Violence Against
Women Act authorization,

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is still sitting on th
desk of Mitch McConnell.

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, we have to operate
in good faith.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:00:59.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have been to be
good faith partners.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have to be willing
to have hard conversations

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:04.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think we have not
gotten this right,

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
as a society, as lawmakers
as a culture,

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:11.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this is an opportunity
through partnership

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
and hard conversations,
to get there.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.576 line:92%
-You were recently honored

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
as Villain of the Week
on Fox News.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Scoff ]
-Is that

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.450 line:92%
[ Laughing ] something tha

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:24.884 line:92%
you take as a point of pride

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
when something
like that happens?

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.455 line:92%
-Let me brush my shoulder.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:30.657 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:31.825 size:88% position:44% line:92%
So let me just say this.

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:32.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so proud
of our daughter Cora.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:36.663
She recently earned straight
"A's"; and, in fact, two "A+",

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
one in Spanish
and one in science.

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:41.568
And, you know, we printed it out
and we put it up, you know

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:45.271 align:start size:94% position:6%
on our family sort of wall
bulletin board

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I did the same thing
when that came out.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
If Fox is calling me
the Villain of the Week,

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is really only evidence
that I'm being

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:54.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
the woman
my mother raised me to be

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:56.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that I am advancing
progressive values

00:01:56.883 --> 00:02:00.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
and making people uncomfortabl
in the pursuit of progress

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:02.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I am perfectly fine
with that.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.525 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, judge me
by my enemies, please.

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Congresswoman,
thank you so much

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:08.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
for making the time
for us today.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.396 line:92%
It was a delight to talk to yo

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.665 line:92%
and keep up the good work.

